    .. grid-item-card:: Conference room occupancy
        :link: /applications/a212/presence_tracking_wall_mount/showcases/conference_room_occupancy
        :link-type: doc

        Up to five people enter a conference room one at a time, sit down and leave again, with a standing fan running the whole time.

    .. grid-item-card:: Open area occupancy
        :link: /applications/a212/presence_tracking_wall_mount/showcases/open_area_occupancy
        :link-type: doc

        Two or three people walk into an open lunch area and stand talking while a passer-by walks through, with a desk fan running the whole time.

    .. grid-item-card:: Coverage map
        :link: /applications/a212/presence_tracking_wall_mount/showcases/coverage_map
        :link-type: doc

        A person stands still in each cell of an 8 × 6 m grid in turn, in four runs, to map where in the room the sensor detects them.
